> Recorded outcomes and limits


Policy: none.

The held-out accuracy is 0.6641 (cross-entropy 0.6388), compared with the last-value baseline 0.5625, majority baseline 0.5000 and marked-value oracle 1.0000. Flipping the marked token gives accuracy 0.6328; flipping only the last distractor gives 0.6562. These are fixed source controls, not additional training. The finite synthetic test pool and short budget limit conclusions about generalization.

All three validation epochs are plotted; the test pool does not select the checkpoint.

