Policy: global.

The held-out accuracy is 0.5391 (cross-entropy 0.6859), compared with the last-value baseline 0.5625, majority baseline 0.5000 and marked-value oracle 1.0000. Flipping the marked token gives accuracy 0.5156; flipping only the last distractor gives 0.5156. These are fixed source controls, not additional training. The fit remains below the last-value baseline under this budget.

All three validation epochs are plotted; the test pool does not select the checkpoint.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/gradient_clipping_global_history.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){std::filesystem::create_directories("build");std::ifstream input("build/recurrent-models/models/gradient_clipping/global/history.tsv");if(!input)throw std::runtime_error("Missing source history");std::string line;std::getline(input,line);std::vector<double> epoch,loss;while(std::getline(input,line)){std::istringstream row(line);double x,y;if(!(row>>x>>y))throw std::runtime_error("Invalid history row");epoch.push_back(x);loss.push_back(y);}if(epoch.size()!=3)throw std::runtime_error("Expected all three source epochs");dm::graphics::RPlot::create().lines(epoch,loss,"Validation objective",{37,99,235}).points(epoch,loss,"All recorded epochs",{234,88,12},5).x_label("Epoch").y_label("Validation cross-entropy").title("Gradient clipping / global: validation history").size(950,520).save_svg("build/gradient_clipping_global_history.svg");std::cout<<"| Epoch | Validation objective |\n|---:|---:|\n";for(std::size_t i=0;i<epoch.size();++i)std::cout<<"|"<<epoch[i]<<"|"<<loss[i]<<"|\n";}

```
