> References

Pascanu, Mikolov and Bengio (2013), On the difficulty of training recurrent neural networks. https://arxiv.org/abs/1211.5063

The compact preset, data, seeds, source initialization and short fit budget above are the repository experiment; they are not a reproduction of the paper's full benchmark.
